            "description_html": "<b>Concealed Electrical Power Transfer, SEC EL-CEPT-613E</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe heavy-duty, tamper-resistant Concealed Electrical Power Transfer (CEPT) securely transfers power and data from the hinge side of the frame to electrified hardware on the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo E8W-BB74545-652 Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Electrical Wires: 12</li>\r\n<li>Connector Type: ElectroLynx™|No Connector</li>\r\n<li>Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1-3/100\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Fire Rated</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Finish: Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with machine screws and wood screws. For use with  heavy metal or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
